            <tr><td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">Apr 23</td><td class="px-3 py-2">Northern Ontario (FW, IS, IDS)</td><td class="px-3 py-2">303</td><td class="px-3 py-2">FW 60, IS 87, IDS 35</td></tr>
